note {
  This workflow runs: Create League -> Create Team -> Create Players -> Add Roster Entry -> List Roster -> Remove Roster Entry.
  Use the sequence order in each folder or run the requests in order manually.
}

docs {
  Weekly Challenges is a separate local-only workflow: admin Prepare -> Catalog -> Configure -> Validate -> Publish;
  entrant Current -> Detail -> SaveEntry -> Results -> WeeklyLeaderboard/SeasonLeaderboard.
  Duel managers each submit five picks, then Invite -> Accept/Decline before the shared deadline.
  Use only isolated local accounts until the combined Weekly Challenges release is authorized.
  1.03 update walkthrough: after verified login and onboarding, ClaimUpdate103
  with the authenticated user_id. First grant shows the centered walkthrough;
  repeating returns already_seen. Do not consume production users' once-only
  opportunities as a smoke test.
}
